# This file exists to keep output/ in the repository.
#
# The shipped .ini files write their products here (root = output/...), and
# hi_class does not create the directory: without it every run fails in
# input_write_info while writing <root>_parameters.ini, *after* the physics
# has already succeeded, so the real error scrolls past unnoticed.
#
# The run products themselves stay ignored (see the rules in ../.gitignore).
